            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mwana w’umuntu, Nebukadineza, umwami w’i Babuloni, yakoresheje ingabo ziwe igikorwa gikomeye aho yatera i Tiro: imitwe yazo yose yatobotse ubuhanza, no ku rutugu hose haramyoka: yamara nta ngororano yabonye, cank’ ingabo ziwe, mu vy’i Tiro, kubg’ igikorwa gikomeye yakoze, aho yahatera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
