            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Eh’ igihugu ca Egiputa ngira nkigomorere Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babuloni; azojana abantu baho b’isinzi ar’ inyagano, ajane n’iminyago yaho n’ isahu yaho; ivyo bizoba ingororano z’ingabo ziwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
